Value ip (.*)
Value mac (.*)
Value type (.*)
Value port (.*)

# Parse the output of "show arp" on an HP AOS-S switch.
#
# Each data line looks like:
#   "  172.16.34.1      f41e57-36fd7c     dynamic 24"
# One record per line.


Start
  ^\s+(?P<ip>\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)\s+(?P<mac>[\w-]+)\s+(?P<type>[\w-]+)\s+(?P<port>\d+)\s*$ -> Record
